---
description: Verify closed pages and retained Tendril history and state.
args:
  input: TendrilEvidence
returns: DeviceTerminalReview
---
Use archive detail. Positive active slots or a presentation still not archived means attention / presentations-remain with the archive ID. Zero active slots with history and state retained means ready / archived-with-retention. Absence of either retention readback means attention / archive-retention-unproved. Cite archive ID.
